{
  "_note": "Spec v2 §11: one visual language for hints. 'items' = the 'this is new' card (NewItemCard): the object's icon, then ▸ its effects as icons and numbers, plus a pulsing gold outline and a '!' burst on the object itself. No hand, no freeze; the card hides after card_s, the outline after outline_s. 'find' says which object on the street to outline: obstacle kind, horde enemy, gate op (+ unit/id), red gate, or a HUD power button. An effect's number is 'text' (literal), or 'from': 'obj.<key>' (the found object's own value: a level override shows; '<key>_pct' wins with fmt_pct when the object has it), 'units.<path>' (config/units.json) or 'value.<rank>' (Codex '= N constables' with the level's upgraded stats). 'hand.tip' = the fingertip in assets/ui/hand.png as a share of its size (tools/make_hand.py prints it).",
